  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1904.10 Penalties. Any insurer, producer, or any person, firm, association or corporation who knowingly violates any provision of this part shall be subject to the provisions of RSA 400-A:15, III.\n\nSource. #8402, eff 8-1-05; ss by #10371, eff 8-1-13; ss by #13779, eff 10-12-23",
